  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss8:3.1.4": "It is interesting to note that both <i lang='pi' translate='no'>uposatha</i> and <i lang='pi' translate='no'>pavāraṇā</i> are here used as distinct from <i lang='pi' translate='no'>saṅghakamma</i>, suggesting neither was regarded as <i lang='pi' translate='no'>saṅghakamma</i> proper. See Appendix of Technical Terms for a further discussion of these two words. ",
